WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
Hi, It's great to join you
at this year's Scientific

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.950
and Technical Awards Show.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.770
Thank you to the Scientific
and Technical Awards committee

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.390
and its chair, Doug Roble, and
Vice Chair, Barbara Ford Grant.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.920
With the help of
the volunteers who

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.130
have committed countless
hours of hard work, scrutiny,

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:21.410
and dedication that makes
these awards possible.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.300
Unlike the subject of the
Lumiére Brothers' celebrated

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.080
short film, Arrival
of a Train at Ciotat,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.680
the motion picture
innovation train never stops.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:36.270
Its progress is, in fact,
vital to the art form.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.950
From the earliest
awards ceremonies,

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.920
the Academy has
recognized and honored

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.350
filmmaking's pioneering
scientific and technical

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.800
advances, like synchronized
sound recording,

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.670
directional mics, image
compositing systems, and color

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.550
film, these achievements
and the many more

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:57.330
that followed represent
decades of focus, creativity,

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:00.330
engineering, and refinement.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.560
Enter 2021, rising technologies
have found their way

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.240
into every sphere of life.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.130
And they're disrupting
the creative process

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.020
at a breakneck pace.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.090
Filmmaking shouldn't merely keep
up, it has the power to lead.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.090
For example, the Academy
Software Foundation,

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.640
which since its
launch in 2018 has

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.140
been facilitating collaborations
among moving image innovators

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.220
through its vibrant
open source ecosystem.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:32.310
Soon the Academy will be
convening its first ever

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.110
innovation summit.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.300
It will bring together
industry leaders

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:41.220
and challenge them to envision
a bold, expansive, inclusive

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:46.330
entertainment future to chart
that future, to shape it.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:49.230
But today, we paused
in the present,

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:52.770
took stock, got to know
some of our fellow riders

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:56.400
on this innovation
train, because today we

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.730
honored 55 individuals
and two companies

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:03.750
for their game changing work.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.930
Oh, oops.

